{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Landed: Gerrit 3452 merged as fa383b1d195a5795271f56baa1fbdb17fcd69f21. Patch set 1 got LLM-Review -1: no test covered the label forwarding in `AcliClient.create_issue`. Patch set 2 adds that test (it fails when the forwarding is removed). It also stops typed-path label-operation dicts from being stringified into Jira labels, now that only plain-string labels plus the identity label are sent, and adds tests for the merge and no-duplicate branches. Patch set 2: LLM-Review +1, Verified +1 (run 44529616374). Local make verify passed on 47bbe3b0452: 21,461 passed plus 226 integration.\nFollow-up filed: `oppressed-topsecret-chickadee` (DC create replay on connection faults; ACLI comment create replay). Windows sweep dispatched: run 44534782876."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795095439145506545,"uuid":"79a73976-2287-40fd-8e1a-e7e057b532ac"}